# Boat landing hall (back layer, no outlines): a wooden hall o/O/l under a
# flat-topped copper roof t/T (t lip = the launch surface, d/l eave
# shadow), a ticket window (w frame, b glass, o/O counter), a timetable
# board without text (d with i/w rows), a life ring r/w (accent, R/i
# rope), wide doors O/l with b glass, a flagpole m/d on a wall bracket
# with a wine/white flag R/w (inside the box), an m/i/d stone plinth.
# Drawn = solid (D-038): the profile is the full 96x96 box = cols
# 280..285 x rows 10..15 (place it at col 282, row 15, dx 8: bottom
# on the row 16 top); the roof top (row 0) is row 10's top, 6 tiles
# above the meadow.
sprite = schiffsstation
size   = 96x96
origin = 48,96
anim   = idle frames=1
